          "distinct": false,
          "id": "55ea558f6b276ea095984d939919d41a1bee547f",
          "message": "fix(ci): re-arm sweeper for dropped auto-merge arms (#3675) (#3684)\n\nArmed review:pass PRs silently lose their auto-merge arm when a sibling\nmerge-group lands (or a group fails); self-arm only fires on label events\nso they stay stuck. Sweep every 10 minutes: re-arm OPEN non-draft\nreview:pass PRs whose autoMergeRequest AND mergeQueueEntry are both null,\nfail closed on needs:*/review-hold labels, bound 10 arms/run.\n\nArms via the sparq-orchestrator App token (batch-merge.yml pattern) so\nresulting merges still fire downstream push workflows.\n\nCo-authored-by: sparq-agent <sparq-agent@users.noreply.github.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-21T19:26:15Z",
          "tree_id": "7c4f4743cb07195a5e44a2135efa4ceccb2e92ac",
          "url": "https://github.com/sparq-org/sparq/commit/55ea558f6b276ea095984d939919d41a1bee547f"
